# Host environment file for agentic-dev-loop.
#
# Copy it outside the workspace (for example to
# ~/.config/<repo-name>/agentic-dev-loop.env) and fill in values there.
# Pass it to a run with --env FILE. Never commit a filled copy: the engine
# refuses a run when the workspace contains a .env* file, and this template
# carries no secret values. Values already set in the process environment
# win over the file.
#
# OPENAI_API_KEY=...
#
# Optional: override the toolchain image for a local build.
# AGENTIC_DEV_LOOP_DEV_IMAGE=...
